---
import { ADS_CLIENT, ANALYTICS_TOKEN } from '../config/site';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy – WhoRuled"
  description="What WhoRuled collects about visitors: nothing by default."
  path="/privacy/"
>
  <main class="page">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0">Privacy</h2>
    <p>WhoRuled has no accounts, forms or comments, and it does not set cookies of its own.</p>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>The site is served by Cloudflare, which processes standard request data (IP address, browser, page requested) to deliver pages and protect against abuse.</p>
    {ANALYTICS_TOKEN ? (
      <>
        <h2>Analytics</h2>
        <p>We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to count page views. It does not use cookies or track you across sites.</p>
      </>
    ) : (
      <p>No analytics are currently running.</p>
    )}
    {ADS_CLIENT ? (
      <>
        <h2>Advertising</h2>
        <p>This site shows ads served by Google AdSense. Google and its partners may use cookies to show and measure ads. Where required (for example in the EU, UK and India's data-protection rules), ads load only after you consent. You can change this at any time from the consent banner or your browser settings, and you can manage ad personalisation at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com">adssettings.google.com</a>.</p>
      </>
    ) : (
      <p>No ads are currently shown.</p>
    )}
    <h2>Tips</h2>
    <p>If you choose to tip, the payment happens in your UPI app or on PayPal's site, under their own privacy policies. WhoRuled only shows a UPI QR code and links; it does not load payment scripts or receive your payment details.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions: <a href="https://github.com/nsijwali/WhoRuled/issues/new">open an issue</a>.</p>
  </main>
</Base>
